3669							; %11101 = 29 = 232-239 = Reserved for Acornsoft sprites [MasRef E.3-34]
3670							; %11110 = 30 = 240-247 = User program calls [MasRef E.3-34]
3671							; %11111 = 31 = 248-255 = User program calls [MasRef E.3-34]
